        "original_id": "72e6b37a-ee03-5efb-b07f-f4fe35f10b90",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johannes Grenzfurthner, Sean Fine, Andrea Nix Fine, Susan MacLaury, Albie Hecht, Sandy Stone\n- Films: Traceroute, War/Dance\n- Organizations: Shine Global, Kean University\n- Publications: ArtForum, Wired, Mondo 2000\n\nFacts:\n- War/Dance is a 2007 American documentary film written and directed by Sean Fine and Andrea Nix Fine.\n- War/Dance was produced by Susan MacLaury of Shine Global, who was a professor at Kean University, and by Albie Hecht.\n- Traceroute is a 2016 Austrian-American documentary film directed by Johannes Grenzfurthner.\n- Sandy Stone has been profiled in ArtForum, Wired, Mondo 2000, and other publications.\n- Sandy Stone was interviewed for documentaries such as Traceroute.",
